{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": ""}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Three Negotiation Strategies"}, {"type": "position", "content": 4}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 1}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.3"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when talking about strategies in IT negotiations!"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Understand information about people's backgrounds in spoken or written documents.   Participate in the improvement of IT contracts, establishing technical clauses that respond to the needs of the negotiating agents, based on current laws on contracting."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of a range of grammar and vocabulary, and with the appropriate level of formality and purpose, coherence and cohesion for the context.  Recognizes simple ideas on concepts on IT contracts and knowledge transfer, simulated processes of IT contracting, and technological negotiation."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "enpe8n7le01ob04re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Be Supposed to in Affirmative Statements"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "<div align=\"justify\">When we want to express that something is expected or required from someone or something, we can use the structure: <span class=\"strong\">be supposed to.</span></div><br /> "}, {"type": "text", "content": "<div align=\"justify\"><span class=\"strong\">Be supposed to</span> in its present simple form is used to say that something is expected or required to happen.</div><br />"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<div align=\"justify\">Take a look at the following examples:<br /><br />   <div class=\"center_text\"><span class=\"strong\">Subject + am/is/are + supposed to + verb base form + complement.</span></div><br />  <li><span class=\"italic\">IT negotiations <span class=\"strong\">are supposed to facilitate</span> the acquisition of new technology.</li></span>  <li><span class=\"italic\">An external consultant <span class=\"strong\">is supposed to interpret</span> contractual terms in a more objective way.</span></li></div><br /><br />"}, {"type": "example", "content": "All parts involved are supposed to have a practical idea of the technical principles."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Most IT agreements are supposed to require an organizational strategy realignment."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Communication errors are supposed to be avoided if some practical rules are agreed upon before the negotiation."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "First Conditional"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "<div align=\"justify\">The <span class=\"strong\">first conditional</span> is used to talk about real possibilities in the present or in the future.</div><br />"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<div align=\"justify\"><span class=\"strong\">Conditionals</span> are divided into two statements: an <span class=\"strong\">if statement</span> and a <span class=\"strong\"> result statement.</span><br /><br />  In the case of the <span class=\"strong\">first conditional</span></span>, the if statement is stated in the <span class=\"strong\">present simple tense</span> and the <span class=\"strong\">result</span> in the <span class=\"strong\">simple future tense.</span></div><br /> "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If statement\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Result Statement\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"IF the IT expert tries to meet the company's interests.  \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It will be beneficial for all of us.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "If a goal conflicts with another, it will be necessary to assess the situation carefully so that there can be mutual gain."}, {"type": "example", "content": "If it's in all negotiators' interests to learn about all the technological aspects of the product that is being communed, an important investment of time will be needed."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "abound"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to exist in a huge amount"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Technology negotiations abound with miscommunication and disagreements due to their extended complexity. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n7le01ob04aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "agree upon"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to come to an agreement"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Communication errors are supposed to be avoided if some practical rules are agreed upon before the negotiation."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n7le01ob04aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "mutual gain"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "when both parties are equally benefited"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:It will be necessary to assess the situation carefully so that there can be mutual gain."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n7le01ob04aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "reap"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to obtain as a result"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Negotiators who use ambiguity as a negotiation tool seem to reap more benefits from a deal."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n7le01ob04aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "commune"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to talk with someone"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: If it's in all negotiators' interests to learn about all the technological aspects of the product that is being communed about, an important investment of time will be needed."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n7le01ob04aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "heed"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to give special attention to"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: First, confer in advance with those who might be affected by the changes; second, heed and grant them an opinion at the end of negotiations; and third, be realistic about the promises that are made at the negotiation."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n7le01ob04aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Find a software or application you think would be useful for a company you have worked, or that is in your area."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Describe the strategies that the company is supposed to use during the negotiation."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Explain the possible changes that the company is supposed to apply in their organizational structure."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Create a chart showing the information."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Compare it with your partners."}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I  find a software or application that can be useful in a company. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I  describe the strategies the company could use during the negotiation. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I  explain the changes in the organizational structure that software would generate. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I  create a chart and compare my work with my partners."}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "type": "sena", "labs": [{"exercises": [{"stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1, "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can list some strategies to cope with technology negotiation.   "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can talk about characteristics for strategies to cope with technology negotiation.   "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can talk about technology negotiation that affects the organizational structure of a company."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "\u25cf\tWho do you think a company should put in charge of an IT negotiation?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "How do you think a company might be affected after the application of new technological changes?"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}], "allowed_attempts": 2}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": "Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "free_type_text_area", "content": "How to Cope with IT Negotiations"}], "id": 0, "img_path": ""}, {"stimuli_ids": [1], "template_override": 1, "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "type": "question"}], "responses": [{"_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0, "id": 0}, {"_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1, "id": 1}], "id": 0}], "type": "STI", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "IT negotiation strategies!"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Content"}]