": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: <span class=\"bullet\">Listen to the audio.</span> <span class=\"bullet\">Click on TRUE if the statement is true.</span> <span class=\"bullet\">Click on FALSE if the statement is false. </span>"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n7le01ob04re6aud02"}], "type": "post_instructions"}], "id": 10}, {"stimuli_ids": [], "template_override": 1, "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "type": "question"}], "responses": [{"_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0, "id": 0}, {"_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1, "id": 1}], "id": 0}], "type": "RSLT", "_data": [{"contents": [], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Quiz"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}], "allowed_attempts": 2}}, {"contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}], "type": "learning_skills"}], "id": 11}, {"stimuli_ids": [], "template_override": 1, "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "pdf", "content": "enpe8n7le01ob04re7pdf01.pdf"}], "type": "question"}], "responses": [{"_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1, "id": 0}], "id": 0}], "type": "DWS", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Let's write about the three strategies in a negotiation!"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Take Away"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}], "allowed_attempts": 2}}, {"contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Let's write about the three strategies in a negotiation!"}], "type": "post_instructions"}], "id": 12}], "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "id": 0, "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "type": "welcome"}, {"_data": [], "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "enpe8n7le01ob04re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "100", "image": "enpe8n7le01ob04re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "<div align=\"justify\">Technology negotiations abound with miscommunication and disagreement due to their extended complexity. If negotiators make assumptions or try to foresee what the future of technology products will be like, they may find some problems in communication. So, communication errors are supposed to be avoided if some practical rules are agreed upon before the negotiation. By doing so, the probabilities to reach an agreement that meets the demands and needs for both parts, will increase. In addition to this, it is a good idea for companies to assign different people to be concerned about specific goals the company intend to achieve. If a goal conflicts with another, it will be necessary to assess the situation carefully so that there can be mutual gain.</div><br />"}, {"time": "46800", "image": "enpe8n7le01ob04re2img02.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<div align=\"justify\">Negotiators who use ambiguity as a negotiation tool seem to reap more benefits from a deal. Having that in mind, if it's in all negotiators' interests to learn about all the technological aspects of the product that is being communed about, an important investment of time will be needed. Additionally, even if a technical adviser is to be brought up the discussion table, all parts involved are supposed to have a practical idea of the technical principles, the pros and cons of different options, and at least a rough idea or estimate of the obstacles that the technological implementation might arise.</div>"}, {"time": "83500", "image": "enpe8n7le01ob04re2img03.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<div align=\"justify\">Finally, an important outcome of an IT negotiation that managers have to deal with is how the organizational structure is affected. Most IT agreements are supposed to require an organizational strategic realignment; therefore, it'll need to be approached in three steps. First, confer in advance with those who might be affected by the changes; second, heed and grant them an opinion at the end of negotiations; and third, be realistic about the promises that are made at the negotiation.</div>"}], "coverimg": "enpe8n7le01ob04re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1, "id": 1, "title": ""}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "type": "scholar"}]}